    {
      "duration_ms": 9000,
      "caption": "Write errors surface once through errseq_t, so check fsync's return value.",
      "narration": "Background writeback errors are reported once, through errseq_t, at fsync. Ignoring its return value can silently lose data.",
      "elements": [
